vcftools-ng is an output-compatible successor to VCFtools 0.1.17 and includes
algorithms adapted from VCFtools, including exact compatibility behavior for
Hardy-Weinberg, population statistics, and output formatting. VCFtools 0.1.17
is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3.0.

The portable distribution also contains HTSlib, bcftools, and selected system
runtime libraries. Their license texts are installed in the package LICENSES
directory. Those components remain under their respective upstream licenses.
